   "answer": "{\n  \"blocks\": [\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"lines\": [\n        \"Work began in March of last year after a survey\",\n        \"found that the retaining wall had moved by nearly\",\n        \"forty millimetres. What was scheduled as a nine-\",\n        \"month job ran into the winter floods, and then into\",\n        \"a dispute over who owned the culvert beneath the\",\n        \"eastern end.\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}",
